<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Мои карточки</title>
<style>
body {
background-color: #f2f2f2;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
padding: 20px;
}

h1, h2 {
font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
text-align: center;   
color: #333;
}

.container {
max-width: 1000px;
margin: 0 auto;
}

.section {
background-color: #ffffff;
padding: 25px;
border-radius: 10px;
margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
flex-wrap: wrap;
gap: 20px;
}

.grid-container {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
gap: 20px;
}

.card {
width: 150px;
height: 150px;
border-radius: 10px;
color: white;
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
align-items: center;
text-align: center;
padding: 10px;
font-size: 18px;
}

.card1 { background-color: #e57373; font-family: Arial; }
.card2 { background-color: #81c784; font-family: "Courier New"; }
.card3 { background-color: #64b5f6; font-family: Georgia; }
.card4 { background-color: #ffb74d; font-family: Verdana; }
.card5 { background-color: #ba68c8; font-family: "Comic Sans MS"; }

.card6 { background-color: #4db6ac; font-family: Impact; }
.card7 { background-color: #7986cb; font-family: Tahoma; }
.card8 { background-color: #a1887f; font-family: "Trebuchet MS"; }
.card9 { background-color: #90a4ae; font-family: "Lucida Console"; }
.card10 { background-color: #f06292; font-family: "Palatino Linotype"; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
<h1>Карточки на Flexbox и Grid</h1>

<div class="section">
<h2>Flexbox</h2>
<div class="flex-container">
<div class="card card1">Сахар</div>
<div class="card card2">Ложка</div>
<div class="card card3">Монклер</div>
<div class="card card4">Можно?</div>
<div class="card card5">50 Баллов? пж</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>Grid</h2>
<div class="grid-container">
<div class="card card6">Мышка</div>
<div class="card card7">Клавиатура</div>
<div class="card card8">Монитор</div>
<div class="card card9">Карта</div>
<div class="card card10">Ромб</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
